  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Vulnerable Refugees through Cash Assistance and Filling Critical Gaps within the Protection Sector.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work with 13 settlements delivering cash transfers to vulnerable refugees where protection risks are the highest. 

Pursuing localisation strategy with a strong focus on capacity building with ambition to hand over a lot of the protection services to local and community actors, cutting across all their work including the cash consortium.</narrative>
  </description>
